C X26 EX RUN-016 | MUST NOT | Do not wrap normal persistence operations in a generic application-level retry pipeline; use the persistence provider's execution strategy for transient faults and handle transaction/retry interaction per the provider's guidance. | persistence resilience | none stated | RUN-016 limits retries to safe repeats; no oracle policy forbids application-level retry of persistence operations or prescribes the provider execution strategy. | Wrapping repository calls in a Polly retry pipeline violates this rule.

